<title>LATVIA: LATVIAN NEW CAR SALES 2,095 BY START JULY.</title>
<headline>LATVIAN NEW CAR SALES 2,095 BY START JULY.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia had registered 2,095 new cars by July 4, a rise from 1,697 cars on June 6, the Latvian Motorvehicle Traders Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 2,095 total so far this year has beaten the 1,318 total new cars sold in the whole of 1996, figures from the association showed.</p>
</text>
